msgctxt "quest/038/XxaFst502_03873:TEXT_XXAFST502_03873_EDELSTEIN_000_002:1"
msgid "General Raubahn awaits you at Castrum Meridianum. The battle will not be an easy one, but I trust that you are up to the task. Godsspeed, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>!"
msgstr "Генерал Раубан ждёт вас в Каструме Меридианум. Бой будет нелёгким, но я верю, что вы справитесь. С богами, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>!"

#. ja: さあ、カストルム・メリディアヌムへお向かいください。<br>先に出陣した「ラウバーン」局長がお待ちです！
#. de: Schreite voran, gen Castrum Meridianum! General Raubahn erwartet dich bereits dort.
#. fr: Le général Aldynn est déjà parti pour Castrum Meridianum, notre principal objectif. Vous n'avez plus rien à faire ici, dépêchez-vous de le rejoindre<nbsp>!
#. speaker: EDELSTEIN
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUlda… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
